('El Estadio Olímpico de San Marcos está en la zona central del campus y tiene capacidad para unos 32,000 espectadores. Cuenta con pista atlética y campo de fútbol, y también es sede de grandes conciertos internacionales. Su acceso está sujeto a la programación de eventos y actividades universitarias.', '{"title": "Estadio Olímpico de San Marcos", "place_id": "estadio-universitario", "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-estadio"}'::jsonb, '[-0.01278679,0.0023728567,0.04311037,-0.11356832,0.0052068443,-0.011125311,-0.002207464,0.013181163,0.020199826,-0.004111678,-0.01632541,0.012317737,-0.029561065,0.021479055,0.16672015,-0.016064895,-0.004068433,-0.03303587,-0.004686201,0.016480679,0.0040879524,-0.038396753,-0.051091123,-0.025090719,-0.030359047,0.00949502,0.020444289,-0.030324688,0.016956924,-0.02887504,0.0049662986,0.06286975,0.009496736,-0.008280287,-0.0063179415,-0.00018187008,0.010415447,-0.019021468,-0.007375908,0.003916844,-0.0045837415,-0.0056661437,0.022630218,0.022046488,0.010679705,-0.009686328,-0.041683838,-0.05741535,0.035010826,0.005338179,0.01453412,-0.0029451365,-0.0357847,-0.31980434,-0.023821184,-0.022413654,-0.0047251275,0.039111093,-0.052945036,-0.0029599913,-0.02969375,0.02539539,-0.02387729,0.0034392658,-0.0038423087,0.043258164,0.013451158,0.047319457,-0.0611686,0.030199574,0.003367812,-0.029341863,0.06948975,0.020113472,-0.024401784,-0.00265747,0.018260231,0.03170806,-0.058920093,0.038774285,-0.010766635,-0.0057443734,0.010994311,-0.013721724,0.009642743,0.0020951342,0.022965752,0.017951854,-0.051591087,0.02058603,-0.011018299,0.011387524,0.014967829,-0.045621432,0.055373088,0.023948576,-0.004532794,-0.02316689,0.0145588145,0.009300121,0.0062422846,-0.0045976057,-0.015022274,0.056863412,-0.010138775,-0.026763566,0.04586908,-0.013508666,-0.0411821,0.0029900945,-0.032196075,-0.009886709,0.023233693,-0.005711236,0.04995247,-0.30271125,0.00018664256,0.00044472527,-0.005501159,-0.025658352,-2.2440609e-05,0.01861136,0.029771402,0.002596625,0.0245192