('El Centro Preuniversitario UNMSM (CEPREUNMSM) está en la Av. Amézaga 60, dentro de la Ciudad Universitaria, y es la academia preparatoria oficial de la universidad. Prepara a los postulantes para el examen de admisión; los alumnos que ocupan una vacante en el cuadro de méritos ingresan a la UNMSM sin rendir el examen ordinario. Más información en cepre.unmsm.edu.pe.', '{"title": "Centro Preuniversitario UNMSM (CEPREUNMSM)", "place_id": "cepreunmsm", "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-cepre"}'::jsonb, '[0.0052112387,-0.014213105,0.046588812,-0.07839272,-0.0029945946,0.062498707,0.040405452,0.013192111,0.01989334,0.00983943,-0.055111475,-0.009566765,-0.03208727,0.0023098846,0.17036727,8.297715e-05,0.00073833286,-0.0017855371,-0.004565973,-0.028184934,0.012823634,-0.020610511,-0.02512318,0.039015472,-0.0112533625,0.06602793,0.03355058,-0.004902472,0.038093034,0.0115574645,-0.032929182,0.061932668,0.00052793475,-0.024713574,0.019784352,0.01084692,-0.004536079,-0.046060666,-0.020797325,-0.0112958895,0.06404561,0.0057052104,0.0074074403,-0.026444655,0.043421987,-0.029828744,-0.050747786,-0.09244763,-0.009576964,0.0069047078,-0.012671881,0.048197597,-0.02435698,-0.3056085,0.01923155,-0.00045215042,-0.025530998,0.0253513,-0.0011899221,-0.045599665,-0.07379319,0.062308215,-0.040073145,-0.023763232,-0.030305384,-0.0034481378,0.007973781,0.033191852,-0.022321532,-0.021943534,0.028132675,-0.02434804,0.031941358,-0.007830024,0.007796215,-0.019936608,-0.047100212,0.016512355,-0.036917366,0.0015603029,-0.010578414,0.013856774,-0.01586938,0.007794683,0.008046281,0.010484023,0.0049716453,-0.018392228,-0.0035341382,-0.025373315,-0.02174471,0.035126258,0.0019271509,-0.06982534,0.016160883,-0.006822774,-0.0032280982,-0.027157415,-0.051655095,-0.033146843,-0.025791684,0.023062278,-0.004103958,0.019569717,0.06143165,-0.10148879,-0.02511153,-0.0074462504,-0.017262513,0.009358907,-0.008875986,0.025324328,0.0060333284,-0.0070665735,0.016382251,-0.29040283,0.0062702275,0.048286725,-0.01475