('La Huaca San Marcos es un monumento arqueológico prehispánico ubicado dentro de la Ciudad Universitaria, en el lado oeste cerca de la Av. Venezuela. Es una gran estructura ceremonial construida por la Cultura Lima a partir del siglo V d.C., con ocupación posterior de las culturas Ichma e Inca. El acceso es libre para los universitarios y está protegida por ley, por lo que no debe deteriorarse.', '{"title": "Huaca San Marcos", "place_id": "huaca-san-marcos", "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-huaca"}'::jsonb, '[-0.032302637,0.037193943,0.033939213,-0.12384015,0.016196955,0.009900479,0.0334549,0.03826785,-0.0068562166,-0.017782627,0.019413771,-0.01847798,-0.020184865,0.03166723,0.15983374,-0.0032150976,-0.0019119912,-0.0377944,-0.010450354,-0.04176962,0.00044375047,-0.04806119,-0.031648338,0.01890402,-0.011260933,-0.00325283,-0.0033867094,-0.03670252,-0.00014218473,0.0047348635,-0.016423848,0.013964528,0.01091559,-0.043323737,0.019714056,-0.0010286596,-0.008493697,-0.044192117,-0.001711732,0.016645236,0.008312336,0.01155478,0.024284702,0.04374298,0.03358007,-0.032174,-0.041618325,-0.08617887,0.011483114,0.007217538,0.02756073,0.008540725,-0.010722171,-0.34266096,-0.007321422,0.016928105,-0.017272882,-0.010160836,-0.0042864955,-0.017886523,-0.09173036,0.041780274,-0.047316253,-0.013931382,0.021785596,0.0199749,0.0016099298,0.061274365,-0.02875909,0.0060820016,-0.027403293,-0.012958772,0.09304334,-0.025286328,-0.0139555875,-0.009106186,-0.03896322,0.029090054,-0.011230835,0.054562718,-0.003646045,0.02891831,-0.024261618,-0.0068939226,0.04292399,0.010521372,0.018139398,0.012687558,-0.021278547,0.011228996,-0.014219414,0.027081553,-0.019091066,-0.070994444,0.064746246,0.0148065705,0.021460235,-0.024687726,-0.040980037,-0.0011621919,0.0019409199,0.027564457,0.01458243,-0.013264263,0.021600109,-0.036705602,0.002792329,-0.019938724,-0.008157192,0.026720313,-0.022065137,0.059810255,0.003071432,0.030685645,0.03165851,-0.29324797,-0.004362803,0.0077338344,0.012864862,-0.07477