('La Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática (FISI) está en la Av. Amézaga, en el extremo norte del campus, y atiende de lunes a sábado de 8:00 a 22:00. Ofrece las carreras de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Ingeniería de Software y es una de las mejores facultades de informática del Perú, con trabajo en inteligencia artificial, ciencia de datos, ciberseguridad y laboratorios de cómputo modernos.', '{"title": "Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática (FISI)", "place_id": "fisi", "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-fisi"}'::jsonb, '[0.010236006,0.016334634,0.021864636,-0.09710966,-0.037297633,0.016212216,0.020364894,0.061202615,0.03114118,-0.01999813,-0.057174366,0.015537241,-0.013685693,0.052008443,0.1687231,0.024473084,-0.0040176646,-0.013412071,0.00012595367,-0.0018574423,-0.003255517,-0.02544859,-0.05046496,-0.04565895,-0.047116987,0.03923216,0.018914714,-0.054117505,0.0331118,-0.045841087,-0.025938379,0.039586794,0.021679943,-0.012110182,-0.0037166337,0.007993581,0.039208878,-0.018347822,-0.020341385,0.043981284,0.028568799,0.018933646,-0.022382742,0.022253597,0.019508943,-0.032304663,0.011909157,-0.050074134,0.009735753,0.037729252,-0.0004067003,-0.0059217317,-0.005260267,-0.3238125,0.015185646,-0.04815558,0.015600696,-0.02945838,-0.016323166,-0.07383242,-0.021481859,0.057659414,-0.042500462,0.010008842,-0.015725719,-0.004690434,0.009998494,0.05045286,-0.003492522,-0.0153663065,0.0049404725,-0.022786656,0.023839595,-0.02448146,0.0024301505,0.021651233,-0.0012755031,0.011197122,-0.01623365,0.032615095,-0.033931583,0.009912149,0.032277375,-0.026176577,0.022350546,-0.015181134,-0.0069243186,0.027621254,-0.010825482,-0.014426823,-0.017002607,0.031293284,-0.059701208,-0.053448312,0.016312506,-0.014115865,0.0036223459,0.0006293619,-0.033408515,0.0028957243,-0.032192755,-0.0033419868,0.019515017,0.027688207,0.0109471595,-0.058455553,0.036605056,-0.04591991,-0.005305069,0.016951602,-0.022710418,0.008525891,0.0043917387,-0.008587417,0.03778702,-0.27578306,0.002