('La Clínica de Odontología UNMSM es un centro donde se forman odontólogos y los estudiantes realizan prácticas supervisadas. Cuenta con clínica propia que ofrece atenciones dentales a precios accesibles para la comunidad universitaria y el público general. Su horario de atención es de lunes a viernes, de 9:00 a 18:00. Para consultas, puede llamar al 619-7000, anexo 3408.', '{"title": "Clínica de Odontología UNMSM", "place_id": "clinica-odontologia", "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-clinica-odontologia"}'::jsonb, '[-0.018540448,-0.010128141,0.018580537,-0.080530174,0.017787766,-0.002145459,-0.00014136455,0.040361643,0.015501549,-0.017887432,-0.027274376,-0.014273068,-0.05329832,0.031226162,0.15435036,0.006960678,-0.05669444,0.0060605486,0.0046033426,-0.024727305,0.027847668,-0.02980707,-0.017359547,0.023219425,0.00011727731,0.014354547,0.061551377,0.0033005856,0.0036411772,0.018888654,-0.005903652,0.039366428,0.008176598,-0.023075623,0.0018896969,-0.0014215009,0.02065845,-0.0054757367,-0.0107934,0.024788493,0.03909568,0.038935784,-0.01319887,-0.009786081,0.040725425,-0.024708338,-0.02881358,-0.07191915,0.016713424,0.018005751,0.021118093,0.030946061,-0.0061039715,-0.30731213,-0.008057596,-0.007873982,-0.026091322,-0.010368211,-0.0011538812,-0.034851003,-0.03785979,0.053719666,-0.028375862,0.007172222,0.012491682,0.00318488,-0.029628374,0.0649988,-0.0036246355,0.02459554,0.024081727,-0.026223976,0.019340258,-0.029567936,-0.033548858,0.008112656,-0.014790041,0.052164163,-0.046764664,0.014062597,-0.006069585,0.04691136,-0.016837098,0.030566948,0.032244775,0.012271203,-0.004758973,0.0051245117,-0.00046124257,0.018396456,-0.014586255,0.010354432,-0.015400872,-0.058021203,0.022955747,0.03615234,0.013738738,-0.041964546,0.0039652325,-0.08101789,-0.040978663,-0.003920478,0.019982358,0.03648547,0.016435146,-0.07293277,-0.03827216,-0.0283764,0.004263661,0.04373443,-0.014455198,0.02955594,0.0067213587,-0.017241333,0.013149008,-0.31642708,0.03759731,0.036832497,-0.030105084,-